    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/138d4e3b67ddcddf09a72edf3cee0cc5.avif?t=1755341305\" width=1560 height=232 /></span><strong>Crimson Horn</strong> is a tactical autobattler where prep is everything and chaos is guaranteed. Recruit your warband, cobble together weapons and banners, and pray your formation holds when the monsters hit. The battlefield shifts. Your plan burns. But if you\u2019re sharp enough? You rise from the ashes and claim glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/292f47e2f1400f79dae811e5ff7d52ec.poster.avif?t=1755341305\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/292f47e2f1400f79dae811e5ff7d52ec.webm?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/292f47e2f1400f79dae811e5ff7d52ec.mp4?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/fbf346e4776aa13a9c106877257226be.avif?t=1755341305\" width=1560 height=232 /></span>After each battle, you will have a chance to recruit &amp; upgrade troops, craft gears, and claim rare relics. Combine your loot through crafting to forge powerful upgrades or unlock hidden effects. Strategic purchases and clever combinations can tip the scales in your favor. Your economy is a weapon, not just a lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/048279f8be6355a4936bcc85c4855fda.poster.avif?t=1755341305\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/048279f8be6355a4936bcc85c4855fda.webm?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/048279f8be6355a4936bcc85c4855fda.mp4?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/bfada99fe60f525e9ac6db35784138d1.avif?t=1755341305\" width=1560 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory doesn\u2019t come from luck. It comes from preparation. Analyze enemy stats, exploit synergies, and adapt your troops with precision. From banner bonuses to unit placement, every choice is a calculated move in your grand design. Win not by chance, but by mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/4aaa3dc8d96eb95f28ce762b9f7669d6.poster.avif?t=1755341305\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/4aaa3dc8d96eb95f28ce762b9f7669d6.webm?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/4aaa3dc8d96eb95f28ce762b9f7669d6.mp4?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dynamic battlegrounds, perfect your tactics, and face ever-evolving foes in your quest for domination. Will your army reign supreme, or will the monsters crush your dreams? The choice is yours. Raise your weapon and fight for victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/a0f72e9a01e75210014b5cfe4b646f36.poster.avif?t=1755341305\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/a0f72e9a01e75210014b5cfe4b646f36.webm?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/a0f72e9a01e75210014b5cfe4b646f36.mp4?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/138d4e3b67ddcddf09a72edf3cee0cc5.avif?t=1755341305\" width=1560 height=232 /></span><strong>Crimson Horn</strong> is a tactical autobattler where prep is everything and chaos is guaranteed. Recruit your warband, cobble together weapons and banners, and pray your formation holds when the monsters hit. The battlefield shifts. Your plan burns. But if you\u2019re sharp enough? You rise from the ashes and claim glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/292f47e2f1400f79dae811e5ff7d52ec.poster.avif?t=1755341305\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/292f47e2f1400f79dae811e5ff7d52ec.webm?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/292f47e2f1400f79dae811e5ff7d52ec.mp4?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/fbf346e4776aa13a9c106877257226be.avif?t=1755341305\" width=1560 height=232 /></span>After each battle, you will have a chance to recruit &amp; upgrade troops, craft gears, and claim rare relics. Combine your loot through crafting to forge powerful upgrades or unlock hidden effects. Strategic purchases and clever combinations can tip the scales in your favor. Your economy is a weapon, not just a lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/048279f8be6355a4936bcc85c4855fda.poster.avif?t=1755341305\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/048279f8be6355a4936bcc85c4855fda.webm?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/048279f8be6355a4936bcc85c4855fda.mp4?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/bfada99fe60f525e9ac6db35784138d1.avif?t=1755341305\" width=1560 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory doesn\u2019t come from luck. It comes from preparation. Analyze enemy stats, exploit synergies, and adapt your troops with precision. From banner bonuses to unit placement, every choice is a calculated move in your grand design. Win not by chance, but by mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/4aaa3dc8d96eb95f28ce762b9f7669d6.poster.avif?t=1755341305\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/4aaa3dc8d96eb95f28ce762b9f7669d6.webm?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/4aaa3dc8d96eb95f28ce762b9f7669d6.mp4?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dynamic battlegrounds, perfect your tactics, and face ever-evolving foes in your quest for domination. Will your army reign supreme, or will the monsters crush your dreams? The choice is yours. Raise your weapon and fight for victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/a0f72e9a01e75210014b5cfe4b646f36.poster.avif?t=1755341305\" width=780 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/a0f72e9a01e75210014b5cfe4b646f36.webm?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/extras/a0f72e9a01e75210014b5cfe4b646f36.mp4?t=1755341305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
